  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN Regional Mine Action Center - Capacity Building and Technical Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Zealand will provide technical expertise to the ASEAN Mine Action Center (ARMAC) to strengthen organisational capabilities through two phases through
&lt;ol&gt;  &lt;li&gt;the development, review, and support the operation of a five-year Strategic Plan;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;the development, review, and support the operation&#xA0; of a three-year rolling Work Plan;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;institutional capacity building of ARMAC; and&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;a training needs assessment and subsequent training of ARMAC staff.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
